{"schema":2,"shard":9,"views":{"corporate":"\n    <div class=\"grid g3\">\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Constitution</div><div id=\"corpConstitution\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:800\">—</div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Beneficial owner evidence</div><div id=\"corpBO\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:800\">—</div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Corporate change risk</div><div id=\"corpRisk\" style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:800\">—</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid g2\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <h2>Corporate change workflow</h2>\n        <div class=\"grid g2\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn alt\" data-bw-onclick=\"runCorpChange('director')\">Director changed</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn alt\" data-bw-onclick=\"runCorpChange('shareholder')\">Shareholder changed</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn alt\" data-bw-onclick=\"runCorpChange('beneficial')\">Beneficial owner changed</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn alt\" data-bw-onclick=\"runCorpChange('office')\">Registered office changed</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn alt\" data-bw-onclick=\"runCorpChange('activity')\">Business activity changed</button>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn alt\" data-bw-onclick=\"runCorpChange('nominee')\">Nominee/alternate arrangement</button>\n        </div>\n        <div id=\"corpChangeOutput\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <h2>Corporate evidence</h2>\n        <div id=\"corpEvidence\"></div>\n        <div class=\"callout small\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">CIPA's 2025 OBRS upgrade requires constitutions for all companies and enhanced beneficial-owner declarations. Nominee or alternate directors/shareholders must also be declared where such arrangements exist.</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\" id=\"cipaRegistryPanel\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n      <div class=\"between row\" style=\"align-items:flex-start\"><div><div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Registry evidence boundary</div><h2 style=\"margin:3px 0 0\">CIPA / OBRS reconciliation</h2></div><span id=\"cipaRegistryMode\" class=\"badge warn\">Manual evidence</span></div>\n      <div class=\"notice\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><b>No live CIPA sync is claimed.</b><div class=\"small\">Upload a current, approved and malware-cleared CIPA/OBRS extract or register-search record, then stage its normalized particulars. Differences never overwrite the workspace automatically; an owner must accept each registry value or record why the workspace value is retained.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"grid g3\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">\n        <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"kpi\">Current snapshot</div><b id=\"cipaSnapshotStatus\">Not staged</b></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"kpi\">Pending differences</div><b id=\"cipaPendingCount\">0</b></div>\n        <div class=\"item\"><div class=\"kpi\">Matched fields</div><b id=\"cipaMatchedCount\">0</b></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid g2\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">\n        <div>\n          <h3>Stage current registry particulars</h3>\n          <div class=\"formgrid\">\n            <div><label for=\"cipaEvidenceId\">Approved CIPA evidence</label><select id=\"cipaEvidenceId\"><option value=\"\">Choose approved evidence</option></select></div>\n            <div><label for=\"cipaSourceType\">Source</label><select id=\"cipaSourceType\"><option value=\"obrs_company_extract\">OBRS company extract</option><option value=\"cipa_register_search\">CIPA register search record</option></select></div>\n            <div><label for=\"cipaObservedAt\">Source observed date</label><input id=\"cipaObservedAt\" type=\"date\"></div>\n            <div><label for=\"cipaRegistrationNumber\">CIPA UIN / registration number</label><input id=\"cipaRegistrationNumber\" maxlength=\"40\"></div>\n            <div><label for=\"cipaLegalName\">Registered legal name</label><input id=\"cipaLegalName\" maxlength=\"160\"></div>\n            <div><label for=\"cipaEntityType\">Entity type</label><select id=\"cipaEntityType\"><option value=\"company\">Company</option><option value=\"business_name\">Business name</option><option value=\"sole_trader\">Sole trader</option><option value=\"partnership\">Partnership</option><option value=\"other\">Other</option></select></div>\n            <div><label for=\"cipaRegistrationStatus\">Registry status</label><select id=\"cipaRegistrationStatus\"><option value=\"active\">Active</option><option value=\"registered\">Registered</option><option value=\"inactive\">Inactive</option><option value=\"deregistered\">Deregistered</option><option value=\"removed\">Removed</option><option value=\"unknown\">Unknown / needs review</option></select></div>\n            <div><label for=\"cipaRegistrationDate\">Registration date</label><input id=\"cipaRegistrationDate\" type=\"date\"></div>\n            <div><label for=\"cipaAnnualReturnMonth\">Annual-return month</label><select id=\"cipaAnnualReturnMonth\"><option value=\"\">Not shown / not applicable</option><option>January</option><option>February</option><option>March</option><option>April</option><option>May</option><option>June</option><option>July</option><option>August</option><option>September</option><option>October</option><option>November</option><option>December</option></select></div>\n            <div><label for=\"cipaRegisteredOffice\">Registered office</label><input id=\"cipaRegisteredOffice\" maxlength=\"240\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <label class=\"checkline\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><input id=\"cipaReviewConfirmed\" type=\"checkbox\" aria-label=\"CIPA review confirmed\"><div><b>I reviewed these particulars against the attached current CIPA source.</b><div class=\"muted small\">The source observation must be no more than 31 days old.</div></div></label>\n          <div class=\"row\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" data-bw-onclick=\"stageCipaRegistrySnapshot()\">Stage registry snapshot</button><span id=\"cipaRegistryStatus\" class=\"muted small\"></span></div>\n          <div class=\"row\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><a class=\"btn soft\" href=\"https://www.cipa.co.bw/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Open CIPA</a><a class=\"btn soft\" href=\"https://www.cipa.co.bw/master/ui/start/CIPARegisterSearch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Search the CIPA register</a><button class=\"btn alt\" type=\"button\" data-bw-onclick=\"showView('vault')\">Add source evidence</button></div>\n        </div>\n        <div><h3>Profile drift review</h3><div id=\"cipaReconciliationList\" class=\"muted small\">No registry snapshot staged.</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"source-note\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><b>Source-of-truth rule:</b> CIPA/OBRS controls official registration particulars. The workspace controls internal operational records. Applying one registry field does not prove every CIPA filing is current and does not submit anything to CIPA.</div>\n    </div>\n  ","servicesmarketplace":"\n  <div class=\"grid g4\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Available services</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"serviceCatalogCount\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Open orders</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"serviceOpenOrders\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">In review</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"serviceInReview\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Completed</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"serviceCompleted\">0</div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid g2\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h2>Professional services</h2>\n      <div class=\"notice warn\" style=\"margin-bottom:12px\"><b>Professional boundary</b><div class=\"small\">Thebe D